            <h3 class="cs-font_24 mt-4 mb-2">CRO vs redesign — which do we need?</h3>
            <p>A redesign changes how the site looks; CRO changes how it performs — and they are not the same project. If your site is structurally sound but leaking conversions, data-driven CRO changes beat a redesign on both cost and risk. If the foundations are genuinely broken, we'll tell you a rebuild is the honest answer and involve our sister company <a href="https://www.apexitsolutions.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apex IT Solutions</a> for the technical work.</p>

